      <div className="bk-placement-note"><p>Editorial maker stories sit beside one clearly marked sample sponsored placement. No actual commercial relationship is represented.</p><button className="bk-placement-toggle" onClick={() => setPlacement(v => !v)} aria-expanded={placement}>{placement ? 'Hide placement note' : 'About featured placements'} <ChevronDown size={14}/></button>{placement && <p className="bk-placement-detail">Mushhk is labelled as sponsored only to preview how a paid placement could appear in a future marketplace. This screen has no booking, ranking, or advertising system.</p>}</div>
